Abstract = {Nowadays, the traffic accident occupies the most scale among all the
   fatal accidents. Driving fatigue has become the main factor which caused
   traffic accidents. But driving fatigue, formed by complex reasons, such
   as traffic marks, environment, drivers themselves and so on, and
   interactive factors, shows the multiple dimensionality and the multiple
   profile characters. Based on safety ergonomics principle, the paper
   analyzes these interactive factors, induces three processing phases:
   perception, judging and acting, concludes the behavior mode of driving
   fatigue and analyzes the mechanism, which is very important on theory
   and practice to prevent driving fatigue and ensure vehicle safety.},
