Abstract = {The ethical aspects of sustainable development, emphasis on ecological
   awareness, ecological culture and importance of spirituality are
   discussed in the article. The prospects of sustainable development are
   considered in the ethical context, based on the accumulated theoretical
   and practical material, assessing the principles of sustainable
   development implementation; environmental consciousness, eco-cultural
   and ethical behavior systems. There is an emphasise on spirituality as
   each culture's values and the existence of distinctive value orientation
   influences the cultural worldview and perception of life. Dynamically
   changing modern era leads to rapid cultural alteration and a broad range
