   Technol HOME Program; Malardalen Univ, Future Energy Profile},
Abstract = {The choice of energy conservation behavior (ECB) is a complicated
   process. In order to examine the feedback of effect of energy
   conservation results under the situational factors ---
   energy-conservation policy; this paper builds a theory model and makes
   surveys on the urban residents of eastern region of China. The results
   show that the intention of energy conservation behavior is not
   coincident with the behavior, because of the regulating effect of the
   situational factors. Perception of results has the feedback effect to
   intention and behavior. Finally, this paper proposes the suggestion to
   optimize energy-conservation policy. (C) 2016 Published by Elsevier Ltd.},
