   James Madison Univ, Dept Grad Psychol, Harrisonburg, VA 22807 USA.
   SUNY Buffalo, Buffalo, NY 14260 USA.
   Univ Florida, Gainesville, FL 32611 USA.
   James Madison Univ, Harrisonburg, VA 22807 USA.
   Monmouth Univ, Long Beach, CA USA.},
