   Zhongjing Cent Invest Co LTD},
Abstract = {To take the net profit maximization of irrigation water capacity it is
   necessary to change the old perception of high yield irrigation in view
   of the lack of agricultural water resources, This paper establishes the
   mathematical model of the optimal assignment problem on irrigation water
   between different crops in irrigation areas, and uses the method of
   Genetic-Simulation-annealing Algorithm (GSAA) to calculate. The method
   not only guarantees global convergent, but also enhances the convergence
   rate and stability. The application in North China Plain has confirmed
   the superior performance of this method and provided a new idea for the
   management of agricultural water resources.},
