Abstract = {We present a patient without hospitalizations in psychiatric facility or
   treatment for more than ten years, which made possible the expression of
   rich symptomatology, especially in the disorganization sphere. A
   detailed description of the symptomatological pallet, from the level of
   the main functions and mental processes: perception, cognition and
   language, quantitative disorders in the field of linguistic, removing
   the signifier from the signified, involving the use of proximate genus
   and shifting from the abstract meaning of the words into the concrete,
   which lowers cognitive function, exclusively at a particular level and
   simplistic operationalization and conceptual impoverishment (along with
   emotional impoverishment). (C) 2015 The Authors. Published by Elsevier
