Note = {International Symposium on Children and Youth Fitness and Health,
   Nanjing, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 28-31, 2010},
Abstract = {To evaluate the self-cognition error of body shapes in adolescents, body
   shapes of 1079 adolescents in ChongQing were tested and evaluated. At
   the same time, an investigation on their satisfactions and
   self-cognitions of the body shapes was made. The results showed that
   huge differences existed in results between the objective testing and
   the self- perceptions of body shape in adolescents. A few adolescents
   were not satisfactory with their body shapes and gender difference was
   obvious in satisfactions of body shapes. So, the cognition error of body
   shapes in adolescents should be taken into account seriously, because
   incorrect cognition could lead to incorrect actions harmed healthiness.},
