   Think Global, Connect Local (Tilburg, The Netherlands)},
Booktitle = {LOCAL GOVERNMENTS AND CLIMATE CHANGE: SUSTAINABLE ENERGY PLANNING AND
   IMPLEMENTATION IN SMALL AND MEDIUM SIZED COMMUNITIES},
