   SCIENCES AND TECHNOLOGY (ICEEST)},
Year = {2018},
Note = {3rd International Conference on Emerging Trends in Engineering, Sciences
   and Technology (ICEEST), IQRA Univ, Karachi, PAKISTAN, DEC 21-22, 2018},
Organization = {IEEE},
Abstract = {This paper aims to explore the acceptance of Web Based Training System
   for in-service teachers at Teacher Training Institute in Nawabshah,
   Pakistan. The main focus is to find out the perception of trainees
   regarding Web Based Training as Continuous Professional Development of
   teachers. The study is based on the Unified Theory of Acceptance and Use
   Technology (UTAUT) model. In order to carry out this study, a
   questionnaire has been designed to investigate the acceptance and use of
   WBTS in teachers' training institutes. Based on the experiments, an
   analysis of the challenges faced by the trainees during the use of the
   technology has also been presented.},
